{
  "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
  "$id": "urn:switchbite:docking-v1",
  "title": "Switchbite docking v1",
  "description": "All results are proposals. Host owns submit/observe receipts. JSON is additionally bounded to 65536 UTF-8 bytes, depth 12, 8192 values, finite numbers, signed 64-bit integers. Task requirements match candidate capability strings exactly. model.judge is optional: injected judge or precomputed judgment; no judgment yields a refusal. No native execution capability.",
